        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Tingkum kathanh guang dat puthe,",
            "Chunsi zaengsi pui tuang gei e;",
            "Kabam kathuih phaengzau bam khou,",
            "Nzianmei nun guai ntang e.",
            "",
            "Hei bui thang bam cho zianmei nun?",
            "Poubaomei tingsaeng gaipui ram,",
            "Guang o, he! Ringhmei mun gaimei,",
            "Rimv gaimei mun tei ladiu khang.",
            "",
            "2. Kagan gaimei taekdat lak khe,",
            "Kachaek namdaih gaimei khou tei;",
            "Rianra rianriu mei naidat lak khe,",
            "Tingsaeng gaichuimei ram khou tei",
            "Nzianmei nun bampui ram tei.",
            "",
            "3. Ai ning e nzianpui ram tei,",
            "Zuan dikho rianra ram khou rui;",
            "Tingsaeng Salem namthanh gaimei,",
            "Nzianmei nun bampui ram tei.",
            "",
            "4. Khuan ngam makge tingkao ram tei,",
            "Khou tei aniu ni bam puni;",
            "Nzianmei nun tam kansini,",
            "Khou tei gaina bam kariuni."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
